#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows as you steer. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"ایک اضافی ارتعاش جو اسٹیئر کرنے کے ساتھ بڑھتا ہے۔ یہ گیم کی\n"
